{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/06448f0beb75d6fcdffa07a58fb8353049b44db4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"19\" /> is expanded in decreasing powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. The second and third terms have equal values \nwhen evaluated at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/a/c6a3d9d78d03ab07e5460047206bb24cfafa694a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/47824b999077df0e84fe40edc6db7fdef6918955.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"11\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive numbers whose sum is one. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/6/706e008a16c671d2eda08f498ba1eae5cf4595e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1/5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4/5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1/4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3/4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8/9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p><br />\nThe second and third term of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/06448f0beb75d6fcdffa07a58fb8353049b44db4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"19\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/3/cb3ef5b68fa6a3f3d4f1cd5698157a7382b2f473.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9x^8y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de546f4fb6d023ffe8e420330ed3f46d8e326a73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36x^7y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />, respectively. For them to be equal when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19a8531373871b279fc778aa78a17f0f88015206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f9395e85ab34f86372deaae56783e0baf9f40af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{p}{4} = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"46\" height=\"33\" />. For them to be equal when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/7/c37f2982a6a912429da2c66e028ff31a12d5831c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"11\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/8/798572665d3246a7626cfb2330682dbd7d4ed428.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b35f7fd97055fe7e2cd69320acf395feaf02a686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+\\dfrac{p}{4} = q+4q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"33\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/4737cb769bd571f9b3830a39261a341954bee0f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{5p}{4} = 5q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/4/f7438ef4e294a113e8a7c7717ba1be6bf8a1d302.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 4q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abf9a70c197d5ea6c0db163f55e40bde1781a88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/4/954cbb787faae52ec047ca6f08c0c06f55feb574.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 4/5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"108\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171918\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2490/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 148/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3678/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.562      1 -total\n 60.27%    9.379      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 37.48%    5.832      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15234:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171918 and revision id 142810. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\